        "heading_chyWyJ": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "We know you'll have lots of questions!",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_fRgBPN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Franki,Ai</strong> our Ai assistant, is here to help you 24/7. She can answer hundreds of your most common questions and even assist with tasks like:</p><ul><li>Canceling orders</li><li>Updating addresses</li><li>Starting a Customer Care request</li></ul><p>For the best results, please be clear and kind with your requests.</p><p></p><h3><strong>Need to Contact Us?</strong></h3><p></p><p>If your question is more complex, our team is ready to help. Please use one of the following methods:</p><p><strong>Customer Care Tickets:</strong> Start a new request using the <strong>\"Contact Us\"</strong> link at the bottom of every page or by using the form in our Help Center. We answer inquiries Monday - Friday, from 9 a.m. to 4 p.m. (excluding holidays).</p><p><strong>Wholesale Support:</strong> For our wholesale partners, please use the dedicated email: <strong>support@rusticstrengthwholesale.com</strong>.</p><p><strong>A friendly reminder:</strong> Submitting multiple tickets or contacting us through more than one channel can cause delays and lead to confusing resolutions. We appreciate your patience with our small team!</p>"
          }
        },
